{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41853","headline":"徐司徒池亭 · 李中","name":"徐司徒池亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亭榭跨池塘，泓澄入座凉。\n扶疎皆竹柏，冷淡似潇湘。\n萍嫩铺波面，苔深锁岸傍。\n朝回游不厌，僧到赏难忘。\n最称收残雨，偏宜带夕阳。\n吟堪期谢朓，醉好命嵇康。\n奢侈心难及，清虚趣最长。\n月明垂钓兴，何必忆沧浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}